$7: LESSONS

LNG:________for_external{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - - For external MCP consumption, validate BASE64(USER_ID:APEX_SESSION_ID) by temporarily attaching the APEX session with APEX_SESSION.ATTACH, comparing the reconstructed G_ID_USER, and always detaching. A test-user bypass or hardcoded fallback must not exist in the active package.", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:________support_auth{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - - Support authorization must resolve the profile and action identifier dynamically from the current user/profile/action tables; neither the action ID nor the SUPPORT profile ID may be hardcoded.", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:________pkg_access_c{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - - PKG_ACCESS_CONTROL.FLOW_ACTION_AUTH second parameter is P_ID_SYS_PROFILE, not a functional action ID. Resolve SUPPORT dynamically through SYSTEM_ROLE.ROLE_NAME and SYSTEM_PROFILE.ID_ROLE; do not source or hardcode a RELEASE_ACTION ID for SUPPORT.", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:______cierre_de_cicl{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - Cierre de ciclo exitoso: 9/9 BLPs completados, documentacion sincronizada, proyecto reestructurado. Patron clave: la migracion de token efimero APEX a token fijo ENVX requiere cambios en dispatch_func, MCP_SERVER gate, y MCP_API_KEY env var.", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:______el_concepto__a{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - El concepto 'api_key' en contexto MCP es confuso porque sugiere una clave de API externa. El término correcto es 'mcp_token'. Toda la superficie del package (JSON, nombres de función, parámetros, SPEC) debe usar 'mcp_token'.", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:______para_compilar_{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - Para compilar en BD: (1) source global-clients/env.sh (2) ssh-tunnel atum — abre tunel en :31523 (3) oracle-sqlcl ENVX_OPER/Vatrox01*@localhost:31523/xepdb1 (4) compilar SPEC primero, BODY despues", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:______initialize_req{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - initialize requiere mcp-session-id header para tools/list", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:______schema_discove{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - Schema discovery via diccionario Oracle (ALL_TAB_COLUMNS/ALL_CONSTRAINTS) sin vistas. AGENT_SKILL extendido con protocolo de consulta e inyectado via my_capabilities. get_catalog con 3 modos: schema_map, columnas, relaciones. search_request_objects requiere fix de filtrado y paginación.", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:______mcp_list_reque{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - MCP_list_requests vigente implementa limit/offset; page/page_size se ignoran. El contrato debe corregirse o documentarse explícitamente antes de aceptar page_size.", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:_______2026_07_31t14{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - - [2026-07-31T14:09:41Z] LNG:cycle-02_completion{type:\"process\", cause:\"27 task(s) completed in CYCLE-02\", lesson:\"Completed tasks show effective cycle planning\"}", prevention:"not_applicable"}
LNG:_____2026_08_05t13{type:"contextual", cause:"not_specified", lesson:"- - [2026-08-05T13:01:58Z] LNG:cycle-02_completion{type:\"process\", cause:\"27 task(s) completed in CYCLE-02\", lesson:\"Completed tasks show effective cycle planning\"}", prevention:"not_applicable"}

