$10: KNOWLEDGE

KNW:knowledge{topic:"project_knowledge", content:"CYCLE-02 closure: 9/9 BLPs completed. BLP-009 implemented fixed mcp_token auth (get_mcp_token generates ENVX-<hex>, MCP_API_KEYS with SHA-256 hash, resolve_api_key, renew/revoke, dispatch_func bifurcated, MCP Server gate + MCP_API_KEY env var). Documentation synced (ESPECIFICACION_TOOLS_MCP.md v3.0, ENVX_ASSISTANT.cortex v2.1, MANIFEST.md updated). Project restructured (src/ organized, archive/ with historics). Key pattern: migrating ephemeral APEX tokens to fixed ENVX tokens requires changes across dispatch_func, MCP_SERVER gate, and MCP_API_KEY env var.\nTRES modos de comunicacion con ENVX: 1-MCP: usa tools nativas opencode (envx_*) via conexion MCP. Operacion estandar. 2-CONSTRUCT: conexion directa BD via sqlcl, SSH, DDL, compilacion. 3-PROBE: pruebas externas (curl, wget, ssh) con proposito diagnostico. Cada modo se declara al usarlo. MCP es default.", status:"active"}

